# OpenStitch interface texts in English (#555): the source every translation copies.
# Generated from the code: OPENSTITCH_WRITE_I18N=1 cargo test -p openstitch-app --lib
# the_english_catalogue_is_current. A translation is assets/i18n/<code>.ftl with the
# same ids and translated texts (see crates/openstitch-app/src/editor/i18n.rs).
ribbon-not-available = Not yet available in OpenStitch.
action-new-label = New
action-new-tip = Start a new design.
action-open-label = Open
action-open-tip = Open an OpenStitch design, or an embroidery file as a new design.
action-openSample-label = Open Sample
action-openSample-tip = Open a ready design from the kit (a satin and fill sampler, shapes, lettering, …) as a new untitled design.
action-save-label = Save
action-save-tip = Save the design.
action-saveAs-label = Save As
action-saveAs-tip = Save the design under a new name.
action-print-label = Print
action-print-tip = Print the design with its colour list through the system print dialog, or save it as a PDF.
action-jobSheet-label = Job Sheet
action-jobSheet-tip = Print a client approval sheet or an operator worksheet with the job's customer, order, due date and notes (design.setJob, design.print; beyond PE-DESIGN).
action-designProperty-label = Design Property
action-designProperty-tip = Sewing information of the design: size, stitches, colours, thread and time.
action-designSettings-label = Design Settings
action-designSettings-tip = Machine, hoop and Design Page size.
action-fabricSelector-label = Fabric Selector
action-fabricSelector-tip = Sewing attributes suited to a fabric type, for all shape and text patterns or the selection.
action-colorPalette-label = Select Color Palette
action-colorPalette-tip = Choose or edit the thread colour charts.
action-wizard-label = Wizard
action-wizard-tip = Create a design step by step: templates or an image.
action-export-label = Export
action-export-tip = Write the design as a machine embroidery file.
action-options-label = Options
action-options-tip = Other applications, settings and the colour theme.
action-exit-label = Exit
action-exit-tip = Close OpenStitch.
action-undo-label = Undo
action-undo-tip = Undo the last change.
action-redo-label = Redo
action-redo-tip = Redo the change undone last.
action-help-label = Help
action-help-tip = Instruction manual, keyboard shortcuts and information about OpenStitch.
action-designDatabase-label = Design Database
action-designDatabase-tip = Browse, search and convert embroidery files in folders.
action-stitchCreator-label = Programmable Stitch Creator
action-stitchCreator-tip = Edit fill, stamp and motif stitch patterns.
action-stitchFactory-label = Stitch Design Factory
action-stitchFactory-tip = Edit decorative stitches sewn along lines.
action-fontCreator-label = Font Creator
action-fontCreator-tip = Create embroidery fonts and map characters.
action-attributeSets-label = Sewing Attribute Sets
action-attributeSets-tip = Save and apply named sets of sewing attributes.
action-threadCharts-label = User Thread Charts
action-threadCharts-tip = Make your own thread colour charts.
action-select-label = Select
action-select-tip = Select objects; drag to move, handles scale and rotate.
action-point-label = Point Edit
action-point-tip = Move, add and delete points of the selected outline.
action-selectAll-label = Select All
action-selectAll-tip = Select every visible object.
action-selectSame-label = Select Same
action-selectSame-tip = Select every visible object sewn like the selection: same thread colour, same stitch type, or both.
action-selectSameColor-label = Same Thread Colour
action-selectSameColor-tip = Select every visible object (or stitch pattern) that sews a thread colour of the selection. Alt-click on a stitch pattern does the same for the colour under the pointer.
action-selectSameType-label = Same Stitch Type
action-selectSameType-tip = Select every visible object with the selection's region sew type (or line sew type for outlines).
action-selectSameBoth-label = Same Colour and Type
action-selectSameBoth-tip = Select every visible object that shares both a thread colour and the stitch type with the selection.
action-cut-label = Cut
action-cut-tip = Move the selection to the clipboard; Paste puts it back.
action-copy-label = Copy
action-copy-tip = Copy the selection to the clipboard; Paste adds a copy of it, here or in another window.
action-paste-label = Paste
action-paste-tip = Add the objects on the clipboard where they were copied from.
action-duplicate-label = Duplicate
action-duplicate-tip = Add a copy of the selection, slightly offset.
action-delete-label = Delete
action-delete-tip = Delete the selection.
action-arrangeCopy-label = Arrange Copy
action-arrangeCopy-tip = Copies in a row or a grid, around a circle, mirrored, along a line or a path, or scattered inside a shape (object.arrangeCopies).
action-copyAttributes-label = Copy Attributes
action-copyAttributes-tip = Remember the sewing attributes of the selected object.
action-pasteAttributes-label = Paste Attributes
action-pasteAttributes-tip = Give the selection the copied sewing attributes.
action-text-label = Text
action-text-tip = Text, monograms, name drop lists, templates and fonts.
action-shapes-label = Shapes
action-shapes-tip = Draw rectangles, ellipses, outlines and curves, or insert preset shapes.
action-rectangle-label = Rectangle
action-rectangle-tip = Drag to draw a rectangle.
action-ellipse-label = Circle / Ellipse
action-ellipse-tip = Drag to draw an ellipse.
action-polygon-label = Closed Straight Line
action-polygon-tip = Click the corners of a closed outline.
action-pen-label = Closed Curve
action-pen-tip = Click for corners, drag for curves; click the first point to close.
action-pencilClosed-label = Pencil (Closed Curve)
action-pencilClosed-tip = Drag to draw a closed outline freehand.
action-openStraight-label = Open Straight Line
action-openStraight-tip = Click the points of an open line; double-click or Return ends it.
action-openCurve-label = Open Curve
action-openCurve-tip = Pen tool: Return finishes the curve open.
action-pencilOpen-label = Pencil (Open Curve)
action-pencilOpen-tip = Drag to draw an open line freehand.
action-zoomIn-label = Zoom In
action-zoomIn-tip = Magnify the view.
action-zoomOut-label = Zoom Out
action-zoomOut-tip = Reduce the view.
action-zoom-label = Zoom
action-zoom-tip = Fit the Design Page, the selection, or 100 %.
action-pan-label = Pan
action-pan-tip = Drag the view (also Space+drag or the middle button).
action-measure-label = Measure
action-measure-tip = Measure a distance on the Design Page.
action-import-label = Import Patterns
action-import-tip = Add an embroidery file to the design.
action-importSvg-label = Import SVG
action-importSvg-tip = Add vector artwork as editable shapes.
action-importPesObjects-label = Import PE-DESIGN Objects
action-importPesObjects-tip = Add a PE-DESIGN 11 file's shapes, texts and stitch groups as editable objects.
action-align-label = Align
action-align-tip = Line the selection up on an edge or centre, relative to the selection, the last-selected object or the Design Page, or space it evenly.
action-alignLeft-label = Align Left
action-alignLeft-tip = Line up the left edges.
action-alignCenter-label = Align Centre
action-alignCenter-tip = Line up the horizontal centres (one vertical line through every centre).
action-alignRight-label = Align Right
action-alignRight-tip = Line up the right edges.
action-alignTop-label = Align Top
action-alignTop-tip = Line up the top edges.
action-alignMiddle-label = Align Middle
action-alignMiddle-tip = Line up the vertical centres (one horizontal line through every centre).
action-alignBottom-label = Align Bottom
action-alignBottom-tip = Line up the bottom edges.
action-distributeHorizontal-label = Distribute Horizontally
action-distributeHorizontal-tip = Equal gaps between three or more objects from left to right; the outermost two stay put.
action-distributeVertical-label = Distribute Vertically
action-distributeVertical-tip = Equal gaps between three or more objects from top to bottom; the outermost two stay put.
action-arrange-label = Arrange
action-arrange-tip = Centre the selection or change where it sews in the order.
action-rotateFlip-label = Rotate/Flip
action-rotateFlip-tip = Rotate by 90° or mirror the selection.
action-size-label = Size
action-size-tip = Scale the selection by a percentage.
action-group-label = Group
action-group-tip = Group the selection so it moves together.
action-ungroup-label = Ungroup
action-ungroup-tip = Take the selected groups apart.
action-stampEmboss-label = Stamp/Emboss
action-stampEmboss-tip = Emboss or engrave a shape, or place stamps in it.
action-modifyOverlap-label = Modify Overlap
action-modifyOverlap-tip = Merge, remove overlap or combine outlines.
action-decorativeFrame-label = Decorative Frame
action-decorativeFrame-tip = Add a frame around the selection.
action-fitText-label = Fit Text
action-fitText-tip = Fit Text to Outline: select a text and a shape, and the text follows the shape's outline. Release Text from Outline takes it off again.
action-backgroundFill-label = Background fill
action-backgroundFill-tip = Fill around the selection with a background stitch.
action-applique-label = Applique Wizard
action-applique-tip = Placement, tack-down and cover stitching for an appliqué.
action-patch-label = Embroidered Patch Wizard
action-patch-tip = A patch with a satin border around the selection.
action-cutwork-label = Cutwork Wizard
action-cutwork-tip = Cut lines and the stitching around them.
action-send-label = Sew Embroidery
action-send-tip = Write the design to USB media, or each hooping as its own file.
action-testSwatches-label = Test Swatches
action-testSwatches-tip = Write a test to sew first: the selection alone, one object with a setting stepped, or a fabric calibration card (beyond PE-DESIGN).
action-checkDesign-label = Check Design
action-checkDesign-tip = List the design's sewing problems, each with a way to show it and, where there is one, a fix (the status bar's Ready to sew indicator).
action-densityMap-label = Density Map
action-densityMap-tip = Show where thread layers pile up and step through the hotspots (Check Design, Density map).
action-reviewSewingOrder-label = Review Sewing Order
action-reviewSewingOrder-tip = Step through every move between objects, with trims, jumps and warnings (Check Design, Sewing order).
action-openImage-label = Open Image
action-openImage-tip = Show an image behind the design (PNG, JPEG, BMP).
action-pasteImage-label = Paste Image
action-pasteImage-tip = Use the image on the clipboard as the background.
action-saveImage-label = Save Image
action-saveImage-tip = Save the background image as shown to a file, or copy it to the clipboard.
action-modifyImage-label = Modify Image
action-modifyImage-tip = Move, scale, crop or adjust the colours of the background image.
action-imageDensity-label = Background Image Density
action-imageDensity-tip = Show, hide or fade the background image.
action-imageRotateRight-label = Rotate Right
action-imageRotateRight-tip = Turn the background image 90° clockwise.
action-imageRotateLeft-label = Rotate Left
action-imageRotateLeft-tip = Turn the background image 90° anticlockwise.
action-deleteImage-label = Delete Image
action-deleteImage-tip = Remove the background image.
action-autoPunch-label = Auto Punch Wizard
action-autoPunch-tip = Regions and outlines traced from an image.
action-crossStitch-label = Cross Stitch Wizard
action-crossStitch-tip = Cross stitches in the image's colours.
action-photoStitch1-label = Photo Stitch 1 Wizard
action-photoStitch1-tip = A photo as fill stitching.
action-photoStitch2-label = Photo Stitch 2 Wizard
action-photoStitch2-tip = A photo as zigzag lines.
action-designCenter-label = Import to Design Center
action-designCenter-tip = Trace a line drawing into outlines and regions.
action-solidView-label = Solid View
action-solidView-tip = Stitches drawn as solid colour areas.
action-stitchView-label = Stitch View
action-stitchView-tip = Stitches drawn as lines.
action-realisticView-label = Realistic View
action-realisticView-tip = Stitches drawn as thread with shading.
action-viewTrimming-label = View Thread Trimming
action-viewTrimming-tip = Show the jumps between stitched areas.
action-viewShow-label = Show
action-viewShow-tip = One aspect of the stitching at a time: needle points, underlay or top only, trim marks, only the selection, colour by sewing order or one colour, solo colour.
action-realisticSettings-label = Realistic View Settings
action-realisticSettings-tip = Thread width, contrast and brightness of the realistic view.
action-paneSewingOrder-label = Sewing Order
action-paneSewingOrder-tip = Show or hide the Sewing Order pane.
action-paneSimulator-label = Stitch Simulator
action-paneSimulator-tip = Show or hide the Stitch Simulator pane.
action-paneAttributes-label = Attributes Setting
action-paneAttributes-tip = Show or hide the Color / Sewing Attributes / Text Attributes pane.
action-paneImport-label = Import Pane
action-paneImport-tip = Show the Import pane.
action-paneAssistant-label = Assistant
action-paneAssistant-tip = Show or hide the Assistant: ask Claude to make, change or explain the design, or to do anything in the editor.
action-reference-label = Reference Window
action-reference-tip = An overview of the Design Page; click to move the view.
action-showGrid-label = Show Grid
action-showGrid-tip = Show the grid on the Design Page.
action-gridAxes-label = Show Grid with Axes
action-gridAxes-tip = Grid drawn as solid lines; off, it is dotted.
action-snapToGrid-label = Snap to Grid
action-snapToGrid-tip = Objects move and draw in grid steps.
action-snapToObjects-label = Snap to Objects
action-snapToObjects-tip = A dragged selection snaps to the edges and centres of other objects, the Design Page and the guidelines, with a dashed guide line. Hold Ctrl (Cmd on macOS) to drag freely.
action-precisionBar-label = Precision Bar
action-precisionBar-tip = Show or hide the bar for typing the selection's exact position, size, rotation and skew.
action-gridSpacing-label = Grid Spacing
action-gridSpacing-tip = Distance between grid lines.
action-ruler-label = Ruler
action-ruler-tip = Show rulers along the work area.
action-guideline-label = Guideline
action-guideline-tip = Click a ruler to add a guideline; drag its marker to move it, click × to delete. Saved with the design.
action-font-label = Font
action-font-tip = Font of the selected text.
action-textSize-label = Text Size
action-textSize-tip = Size of the selected text.
action-fontFilter-label = Font Filter
action-fontFilter-tip = Show only the fonts chosen in Font Filter Settings.
action-fontFilterSettings-label = Font Filter Settings
action-fontFilterSettings-tip = Choose the fonts the filter shows.
action-trueType-label = TrueType Font Attribute Setting
action-trueType-tip = Load a TrueType or OpenType font into the design.
action-editText-label = Edit Text
action-editText-tip = Change the characters of the selected text.
action-editCharacter-label = Edit Character
action-editCharacter-tip = Offset, rotation and size of the character picked with Point Edit (drag it, its rotate handle or its corners on the canvas).
action-lineColor-label = Line color
action-lineColor-tip = Thread colour of the outline.
action-lineSewType-label = Line sew type
action-lineSewType-tip = How the outline is sewn (running, triple, zigzag, motif…).
action-regionColor-label = Region color
action-regionColor-tip = Thread colour of the region.
action-regionSewType-label = Region sew type
action-regionSewType-tip = How the region is sewn (fill, satin, programmable…).
action-toBlocks-label = Convert to Blocks
action-toBlocks-tip = Turn the stitch pattern into editable regions.
action-toStitches-label = Convert to Stitches
action-toStitches-tip = Turn the selection into a stitch pattern.
action-toOutline-label = Convert to Outline
action-toOutline-tip = Text: one shape per character. Stitches: their outline.
action-edgeRadius-label = Edge radius
action-edgeRadius-tip = Round the corners of the rectangles you draw.
action-punch-label = Straight Block
action-punch-tip = Click both ends of each sewing-direction line.
action-curvedBlock-label = Curved Block
action-curvedBlock-tip = Click both ends of each sewing-direction line; the sides curve through them.
action-running-label = Running
action-running-tip = Running stitch between clicked points.
action-feed-label = Feed
action-feed-tip = Jump between clicked points.
action-satinSkeleton-label = Satin Skeleton
action-satinSkeleton-tip = Click (or drag for curves) the centre line of a satin column; drag the handles beside each point to set its width. Double-click or Return ends it.
action-skeletonWidth-label = Column width
action-skeletonWidth-tip = Width of the next points the Satin Skeleton tool places.
action-deriveSkeleton-label = Satin Skeleton from Shape
action-deriveSkeleton-tip = Sew the selected shape as satin along a centre line derived from its outline (an approximation of its medial axis).
action-smoothShape-label = Smooth Shape
action-smoothShape-tip = Remove the nodes of the selected outlines that deviate less than the smoothing tolerance (curves refitted, corners and open ends kept). A Manual Punch column loses one direction line per click; click again to smooth further.
action-smoothTolerance-label = Smooth tolerance
action-smoothTolerance-tip = How far Smooth Shape may move an outline (default 0.2 mm).
action-knife-label = Knife
action-knife-tip = Click the points of an open cut line; double-click or Return cuts every object it crosses (fills and outlines into both sides, satin columns across, lines where crossed). Shift: 45° steps. A single click then Return splits the line under the pointer. Stays active; Esc leaves.
action-shapeEffects-label = Shape Effects
action-shapeEffects-tip = Warp, twist, roughen, pucker & bloat or zigzag the selected outlines, with a preview; the result is ordinary editable geometry (shape.effect).
action-shapeBuilder-label = Shape Builder
action-shapeBuilder-tip = Select two or more overlapping shapes, then drag across the pieces of their overlaps: the pieces you touch become one shape (sewn like the topmost of them). Hold Alt to remove the pieces instead.
action-lineGap-label = Turning Gap
action-lineGap-tip = Leave part of the selected closed line unsewn, the opening for turning in-the-hoop pieces: where it starts along the outline and how long it is. Running, triple, zigzag, E and V lines.
action-splitOutline-label = Split Outline
action-splitOutline-tip = Draw a cut line that splits the selected shape.
action-addDirection-label = Add Direction Line
action-addDirection-tip = Draw a curved sewing direction across the region.
action-deleteDirection-label = Delete Direction Line
action-deleteDirection-tip = Back to a straight sewing direction.
action-reverseDirection-label = Reverse Direction Line
action-reverseDirection-tip = Sew the direction line the other way.
action-editPoint-label = Edit Point
action-editPoint-tip = Move the points of the outline.
action-deletePoint-label = Delete Point
action-deletePoint-tip = Delete the selected point.
action-splitAtPoint-label = Split at Point
action-splitAtPoint-tip = Split the stitch pattern at the selected needle point.
action-regionToLine-label = Convert Region to Line
action-regionToLine-tip = Sew the outline with a running stitch in the region's colour.
action-offsetLines-label = Create Offset Lines
action-offsetLines-tip = Lines inside or outside the outline.
action-floral-label = Create Floral Pattern
action-floral-tip = A floral pattern inside the outline.
action-entryExit-label = Entry/Exit Points
action-entryExit-tip = Where the region and line start and end.
action-sewingPoints-label = Center/Reference Point
action-sewingPoints-tip = Centre point of radial fills and the reference point of stitch patterns.
action-splitStitchData-label = Split Stitch Data
action-splitStitchData-tip = Draw around stitches to split them off.
action-changeColor-label = Change Color
action-changeColor-tip = Change a thread colour of the stitch pattern.
action-divideByColor-label = Divide by Color
action-divideByColor-tip = One stitch pattern per thread colour.
action-smoothStitches-label = Smooth Stitches
action-smoothStitches-tip = Even out the selected needle points (or the whole stitch pattern): each moves halfway towards the midpoint of its neighbours. Jumps, trims, colour changes and the ends of each run stay; the number of points does not change.
action-connect-label = Connect
action-connect-tip = The pattern sewn later starts where the earlier one ends.
action-toOutlines-label = Convert to Outlines
action-toOutlines-tip = One outline per thread colour of the stitches.
action-moveSections-label = Move Sections
action-moveSections-tip = Drag the split lines of a split design to move its sections.
action-exportSections-label = Export Sections
action-exportSections-tip = One file per hooping of a design larger than the hoop.
